{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05411","headline":"岐王席上咏美人 · 张谔","name":"岐王席上咏美人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半额画双蛾，盈盈烛下歌。\n玉杯寒意少，金屋夜情多。\n香艳王分帖，裙娇敕赐罗。\n平阳莫相妬，唤出不如他。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}